{
    "title": "Nike SNKRS: Shoes & Streetwear",
    "description": "Explore, buy, and unlock the best of Nike, Jordan, and Converse. The SNKRS App provides Nike Members insider access to the latest launches, exclusive releases, and shopping experiences that Nike has to offer.\r\n\r\nSNKRS FEATURES\r\n\r\nSTAY A STEP AHEAD\r\n* Shop: Buy the latest styles across footwear and streetwear\r\n* Set Notifications: View upcoming drops and prepare for the shoes you want most\r\n* Reserve with SNKRS Pass: Secure your pair with SNKRS and pick it up at your nearest retailer for a seamless launch day experience\r\n* Get Exclusive Access: Get rewarded with invite-only launches to some of the most coveted styles, available only for select Nike Members\r\n* Catch Surprise Drops: Be ready for a range of unique launch scavenger hunts \u2013 access might be hidden in geo-located events, scannable augmented reality targets or scratch-able images\r\n\r\nEXPLORE THE COMMUNITY\r\n* View SNKRS Stories: Learn about the inspiration and heritage behind your favorite styles and the untold tales from the SNKRS community\r\n* Vote on Polls: Have your voice heard in the sneaker community by answering questions that inform everything from future products to experiences and content\r\n* Watch SNKRS Live: Tune in for livestreams with SNKRS and become a part of the conversation with live polling, never before heard stories, the insider scoop and more\r\n* Discover the NBHD: Learn more about the global network of Nike partners and brands that inspire their communities, and connect with your local doors\r\n\r\nHOW TO GET STARTED\r\n* Sign up or log in with your Nike account\r\n* Save your correct name, size and shipping address under your profile so you are ready for launch day\r\n\r\nJoin the community today.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Explore, buy, and unlock the best of Nike, Jordan, and Converse. The SNKRS App provides Nike Members insider access to the latest launches, exclusive releases, and shopping experiences that Nike has to offer.<br><br>SNKRS FEATURES<br><br>STAY A STEP AHEAD<br>* Shop: Buy the latest styles across footwear and streetwear<br>* Set Notifications: View upcoming drops and prepare for the shoes you want most<br>* Reserve with SNKRS Pass: Secure your pair with SNKRS and pick it up at your nearest retailer for a seamless launch day experience<br>* Get Exclusive Access: Get rewarded with invite-only launches to some of the most coveted styles, available only for select Nike Members<br>* Catch Surprise Drops: Be ready for a range of unique launch scavenger hunts \u2013 access might be hidden in geo-located events, scannable augmented reality targets or scratch-able images<br><br>EXPLORE THE COMMUNITY<br>* View SNKRS Stories: Learn about the inspiration and heritage behind your favorite styles and the untold tales from the SNKRS community<br>* Vote on Polls: Have your voice heard in the sneaker community by answering questions that inform everything from future products to experiences and content<br>* Watch SNKRS Live: Tune in for livestreams with SNKRS and become a part of the conversation with live polling, never before heard stories, the insider scoop and more<br>* Discover the NBHD: Learn more about the global network of Nike partners and brands that inspire their communities, and connect with your local doors<br><br>HOW TO GET STARTED<br>* Sign up or log in with your Nike account<br>* Save your correct name, size and shipping address under your profile so you are ready for launch day<br><br>Join the community today.",
